        "catalog": {
          "F000": {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 83,
            "text": "49 CFR 1540.111 — Carriage of weapons, explosives, and incendiaries by individuals.",
            "structural_parent_refs": []
          },
          "F001": {
            "start": 85,
            "end": 327,
            "text": "(a) On an individual's person or accessible property—prohibitions. Except as provided in paragraph (b) of this section, an individual may not have a weapon, explosive, or incendiary, on or about the individual's person or accessible property—",
            "structural_parent_refs": []
          },
          "F002": {
            "start": 329,
            "end": 546,
            "text": "(1) When performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter;",
            "structural_parent_refs": [
              "F001"
            ]
          },
          "F003": {
            "start": 548,
            "end": 608,
            "text": "(2) When the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or",
            "structural_parent_refs": [
              "F001"
            ]
          },
          "F004": {
            "start": 610,
            "end": 769,
            "text": "(3) When the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.",
            "structural_parent_refs": [
              "F001"
            ]
          },
          "F005": {
            "start": 771,
            "end": 988,
            "text": "(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:",
            "structural_parent_refs": []
          },
          "F006": {
            "start": 990,
            "end": 1129,
            "text": "(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport.",
            "structural_parent_refs": [
              "F005"
            ]
          },
          "F007": {
            "start": 1131,
            "end": 1282,
            "text": "(2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter.",
            "structural_parent_refs": [
              "F005"
            ]
          },
          "F008": {
            "start": 1284,
            "end": 1374,
            "text": "(3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.",
            "structural_parent_refs": [
              "F005"
            ]
          },
          "F009": {
            "start": 1376,
            "end": 1556,
            "text": "(c) In checked baggage. A passenger may not transport or offer for transport in checked baggage or in baggage carried in an inaccessible cargo hold under § 1562.23 of this chapter:",
            "structural_parent_refs": []
          },
          "F010": {
            "start": 1558,
            "end": 1584,
            "text": "(1) Any loaded firearm(s).",
            "structural_parent_refs": [
              "F009"
            ]
          },
          "F011": {
            "start": 1586,
            "end": 1621,
            "text": "(2) Any unloaded firearm(s) unless—",
            "structural_parent_refs": [
              "F009"
            ]
          },
          "F012": {
            "start": 1623,
            "end": 1809,
            "text": "(i) The passenger declares to the aircraft operator, either orally or in writing, before checking the baggage, that the passenger has a firearm in his or her bag and that it is unloaded;",
            "structural_parent_refs": [
              "F011"
            ]
          },
          "F013": {
            "start": 1811,
            "end": 1840,
            "text": "(ii) The firearm is unloaded;",
            "structural_parent_refs": [
              "F011"
            ]
          },
          "F014": {
            "start": 1842,
            "end": 1901,
            "text": "(iii) The firearm is carried in a hard-sided container; and",
            "structural_parent_refs": [
              "F011"
            ]
          },
          "F015": {
            "start": 1903,
            "end": 2010,
            "text": "(iv) The container in which it is carried is locked, and only the passenger retains the key or combination.",
            "structural_parent_refs": [
              "F011"
            ]
          },
          "F016": {
            "start": 2012,
            "end": 2057,
            "text": "(3) Any unauthorized explosive or incendiary.",
            "structural_parent_refs": [
              "F009"
            ]
          },
          "F017": {
            "start": 2059,
            "end": 2291,
            "text": "(d) Ammunition. This section does not prohibit the carriage of ammunition in checked baggage or in the same container as a firearm. Title 49 CFR part 175 provides additional requirements governing carriage of ammunition on aircraft.",
            "structural_parent_refs": []
          }
        }
      }
    ],
